 ldren and their parents as they sing\, move\, play instruments\, and tell 
 stories in Mandarin\, English and American Sign Language. All levels of Ma
 ndarin fluency from absolute beginners to native Mandarin speakers are wel
 come.\nProgram presented in partnership with Friends of the Tigard Library
 .
