DESCRIPTION:The BrazilTones are Deborah Bayardino on vocals\, Ronnie Robin
 s on guitar and vocals\, and Brian L. Davis on percussion. They embrace th
 e rhythmic wonder of bossa nova\, samba and MPB (Música Popular Brasileir
 a)\, performing timeless Brazilian classics alongside original composition
 s. Inspired by the poetic lyrics and rich sounds of Brazilian music\, The 
 BrazilTones share joy -- a universal language that unites us all.\nFor adu
 lts. Held at the Library Hearth.
