DESCRIPTION:Learn what to expect from hospice\, the roles of the care team
  members\, how it is paid for\, and when it might be time. It is important
  to know what questions to ask when searching for the best fit\, as well a
 s understanding how to advocate when needed. Join us in a conversation to 
 more fully understand hospice and how this benefit can support you or your
  loved one during this tender time. Presented by Sarah Vevoda\, LMSW\, eld
 er care consultant and end of life doula.
