SUMMARY:Understanding Social Security
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260630T131500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260630T141500
UID:69f6621dbd5c392c764807c5@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you understand how Social Security works? Have you wondered
  who is eligible for Social Security payments?\nThis engaging and educatio
 nal workshop\, presented by AARP\, focuses on building a basic understand
 ing of Social Security\, exploring how claiming decisions affect payments\
 , identifying useful resources\, and helping you build confidence in makin
 g the right decisions for your personal situation.
LOCATION:Aloha Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f6621dbd5c392c764807c5
