END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All Ages Storytime Session 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260624T101500
UID:69b9c386b48451fc3c09987c@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome preschoolers birth to six and their caregivers!\nAtten
 ding All Ages Storytime is a great way to build a caring bond between chil
 d and adult.\nIn this program\, you and your child will sing songs\, liste
 n to stories\, dance to music\, engage in interactive play\, and so much m
 ore!\n10 minutes of playtime follows session 1. 30 minutes of playtime fol
 lows session 2.\nArrive anytime between 9:30 a.m. – 10:00a.m. to enjoy t
 his program. We understand how difficult it is to be punctual with childre
 n. Playtime is just as beneficial as the storytime.\nThe library opens at 
 10:00 a.m.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Community Room\, main floor
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b9c386b48451fc3c09987c
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
